{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"scb47d7045c57535a","language":"ja","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7486-c87b67818b618ad8838a","text":"列車が変なのじゃ、見えない何かがおるみたいなのじゃ……","speaker":"パム"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-60fc6afadb3a082d918a","text":"早く帰ってくるのじゃああああああ！！","speaker":"パム"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-9e12844fa7a9ea69fed4","text":"パムはすごく怖がりなんだ{M#な}{F#ね}","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-1b5da98a79e6644bf4fd","text":"パムはすごく怖がりなんだ{M#な}{F#ね}","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-4b383d57d2e7e9de7b67","text":"落ち着いて、すぐに戻るから","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-17b794bc3b9fb682fc64","text":"落ち着いて、すぐに戻るから","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-08b4dae9bc7713c85a8a","text":"はやく戻ってきてくれ！この件が解決しない限り、列車は発車させんぞ！","speaker":"パム"}]}
